questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a high-throughput Spring Boot microservice crashes with `java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Metaspace` after running smoothly for several days. Review the following component responsible for dynamic business rule evaluation:

java
@Service
public class RuleEngineService {
    public Object evaluateRule(String ruleScript, Map<String, Object> context) throws Exception {
        // Load and execute dynamic Groovy script per request
        GroovyClassLoader classLoader = new GroovyClassLoader();
        Class<?> scriptClass = classLoader.parseClass(ruleScript);
        GroovyObject scriptInstance = (GroovyObject) scriptClass.getDeclaredConstructor().newInstance();
        return scriptInstance.invokeMethod("run", context);
    }
}
